    {
      "id": "JSgQWaY6rCyonSjj8WNxI",
      "x": -264,
      "y": 1408,
      "width": 374.304,
      "height": 520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1476827776,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1207064693,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792102047998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Assumptions\n\n1. Delivery is at-least-once end to end, so\nevery transform is idempotent and keyed on\nevent id.\n\n2. No synchronous service-to-service calls:\ncomponents meet only at the stream, the bus\nor the queue, and each scales on its own\nbacklog.\n\n3. All compute is serverless or auto-scaled.\nNothing on the critical path is a single\ninstance.\n\n4. Every queue has a DLQ (5 receives), every\njob a Step Functions catch, every write a\nretry with jitter.\n\n5. eu-west-1 across 3 AZs; RPO 15 min / RTO\n1 h via S3 cross-region replication and Redshift\nsnapshots to us-east-1.\n\n6. AWS Config, Secrets Manager and AWS\nBackup are enabled account-wide and left off\nthe canvas.",
      "originalText": "Assumptions\n\n1. Delivery is at-least-once end to end, so\nevery transform is idempotent and keyed on\nevent id.\n\n2. No synchronous service-to-service calls:\ncomponents meet only at the stream, the bus\nor the queue, and each scales on its own\nbacklog.\n\n3. All compute is serverless or auto-scaled.\nNothing on the critical path is a single\ninstance.\n\n4. Every queue has a DLQ (5 receives), every\njob a Step Functions catch, every write a\nretry with jitter.\n\n5. eu-west-1 across 3 AZs; RPO 15 min / RTO\n1 h via S3 cross-region replication and Redshift\nsnapshots to us-east-1.\n\n6. AWS Config, Secrets Manager and AWS\nBackup are enabled account-wide and left off\nthe canvas.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "5BBx63kFQ9e0SPKVG19HL",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b7p",
      "customData": {
        "arkitect": {
          "node": "note"
        }
      }
    },
